 sgiving Pererenan: A Neighbourhood Feast invites locals and visitors alike
  to gather at Noema Resort Pererenan on Saturday\, 28 November 2026\, for 
 a day of food\, music and creative activities. Taking place across the res
 ort’s lobby and front yard from 2pm to 9pm \, Pasar Thanksgiving Pereren
 an gathers local food and beverage brands\, creative entrepreneurs\, artis
 ans and artists in a lively neighbourhood market setting . Visitors can ex
 plore food stalls from participating brands\, including Noema’s own Mama
 loma and Paparempa \, alongside Nasgero\, Snoo Donuts\, Tample Somari and 
 Mad Burger. At the heart of the celebration is The Gratitude Long Table \,
  a communal dining experience where 100 guests will be invited to share a 
 complimentary dinner. The gathering aims to bring people from different ba
 ckgrounds together over a shared meal\, celebrating the spirit of connecti
 on and togetherness.\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-even
 ts/pasar-thanksgiving-pererenan-a-neighbourhood-feast/\n\nPlease verify wi
 th the organizer before attending.
