SEQUENCE:1
SUMMARY:Earth Company Presents Re: Bali 2026
LOCATION:Mana Earthly Paradise
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, 28 November 2026\, Earth Company is set to host R
 e: Bali 2026 at venue partner Mana Earthly Paradise\, Ubud. Themed “Inne
 r to Outer Regeneration”\, this year’s event will run from 12pm to 6pm
 . A social enterprise based in Bali and Japan\, Earth Company aims to deve
 lop regenerative futures that holistically enhance planetary well-being th
 rough three programmes: Impact Heroes – an accelerator programme empower
 ing unique changemakers from the Asia-Pacific in shaping regenerative futu
 res\; Impact Academy – a transformative experiential programme that empo
 wers institutions\, companies and schools to build regenerative futures\; 
 and Mana Earthly Paradise – an award-winning next-generation eco-villa i
 n Ubud that embodies circularity and regeneration. Following its debut las
 t year – which drew over 100 participants and more than 60 organisations
  and social enterprises – Re: Bali shifts its focus to the people drivin
 g the work. This edition asks what regeneration demands of the people and 
 organisations working for the island. At Earth Company\, regeneration star
 ts within. Grounded\, supported\, and connected changemakers create lastin
 g impact across their communities and Bali’s environment.\n\nMore info: 
 https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/earth-company-presents-re-bali-2
 026/\n\nPlease verify with the organizer before attending.
URL:https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/earth-company-presents-re-bal
 i-2026/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
